content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Show Producer",
      "description": "A person responsible for developing and overseeing a television show's production."
    },
    {
      "name": "Show Proposal",
      "description": "A document outlining a new show's concept and details for approval.",
      "attributes": [
        "Show"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Show",
      "description": "A television program produced for broadcast.",
      "attributes": [
        "Budget Plan",
        "Shooting Schedule",
        "Show Cut"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget Plan",
      "description": "An estimated cost outline for producing a show."
    },
    {
      "name": "Shooting Schedule",
      "description": "A planned timeline for filming sessions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Show Cut",
      "description": "The completed version of a show after editing."
    },
    {
      "name": "Regisseur",
      "description": "A director responsible for creative direction during filming."
    },
    {
      "name": "Filming",
      "description": "The process of recording footage for a show."
    },
    {
      "name": "Raw Footage",
      "description": "Unedited video material recorded during filming."
    },
    {
      "name": "Film Editor",
      "description": "A specialist who assembles and refines footage into the final show cut."
    },
    {
      "name": "Post Production Meeting",
      "description": "A session where the final show cut is reviewed and discussed."
    },
    {
      "name": "Channel Manager",
      "description": "An executive responsible for approving, scheduling, and evaluating shows on the channel."
    },
    {
      "name": "Broadcast Slot",
      "description": "A scheduled time segment for airing a specific show.",
      "attributes": [
        "Show"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Audience Feedback",
      "description": "Responses and opinions collected from viewers after broadcast."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Broadcasting": {
      "objects": [
        "Channel Manager",
        "Broadcast Slot",
        "Show",
        "Audience Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Proposal": {
      "objects": [
        "Show Producer",
        "Show Proposal",
        "Show",
        "Budget Plan"
      ]
    },
    "Editing": {
      "objects": [
        "Film Editor",
        "Show Cut",
        "Post Production Meeting"
      ]
    },
    "Production": {
      "objects": [
        "Regisseur",
        "Filming",
        "Show",
        "Shooting Schedule",
        "Raw Footage"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Broadcasting": {
      "derived from": "Broadcasting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Channel Manager",
        "Broadcast Slot",
        "Show",
        "Audience Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Proposal": {
      "derived from": "Proposal Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Show Producer",
        "Show Proposal",
        "Show",
        "Budget Plan"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Show -> Show Concept"
      ]
    },
    "Editing": {
      "derived from": "Editing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Film Editor",
        "Show Cut",
        "Post Production Meeting"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Production": {
      "derived from": "Production Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Regisseur",
        "Filming",
        "Show",
        "Shooting Schedule",
        "Raw Footage"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Show -> Production"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
